# Test: Gabryel's Cards equip page names Shreeker's power-up: "Venom Claw poison: 2x damage". Gabryel (id 2) is
# put in party slot 0 and given Shreeker; X, Items, Cards.
include boot_from_save
wait 100
poke u8 0x0213BA09 1
poke u16 0x020B464C 2
poke u32 0x020B46CC 20
press X 3
wait 80
press Down 8
wait 20
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press Right 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot vc_00
